1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,999
=No Way! My Bro Is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,160
=Episode 21=

19
00:01:17,490 --> 00:01:18,290
Your Majesty.

20
00:01:19,490 --> 00:01:20,260
How was it?

21
00:01:20,490 --> 00:01:21,420
Have you found Gu Bei?

22
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,609
Official Gu

23
00:01:22,610 --> 00:01:24,060
is at the Princess Royal's residence.

24
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:28,129
Her Highness asked me

25
00:01:28,130 --> 00:01:29,810
to deliver this letter to you.

26
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:33,900
Aunt

27
00:01:34,580 --> 00:01:36,530
wants to marry Gu Bei?

28
00:01:37,300 --> 00:01:38,800
I didn't know

29
00:01:39,050 --> 00:01:41,340
you were this skilled.

30
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:43,650
A good blacksmith needs solid skills.

31
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:45,810
A boss who can't do the job

32
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:47,810
isn't a good boss.

33
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:50,170
(What is Gu Bei up to now?)

34
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:54,620
Your Majesty, you're here.

35
00:01:54,770 --> 00:01:55,650
Please have a seat.

36
00:01:57,900 --> 00:01:59,900
I've come today

37
00:02:00,210 --> 00:02:02,090
to confirm what was written

38
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:03,969
in your letter.

39
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:05,860
Your Majesty, you know

40
00:02:05,940 --> 00:02:07,289
I've been alone for years

41
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:09,340
and have never found a suitable husband.

42
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:11,019
But ever since I met Gu Bei,

43
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:12,220
I knew

44
00:02:12,330 --> 00:02:14,020
he was the one for me.

45
00:02:17,050 --> 00:02:17,690
Aunt,

46
00:02:18,770 --> 00:02:20,020
I'm afraid

47
00:02:20,050 --> 00:02:21,410
this matter still needs discussion.

48
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:23,220
Gu Bei.

49
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:26,340
Put that down.

50
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:28,620
Come back to the palace with me.

51
00:02:29,210 --> 00:02:30,220
I have something

52
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:32,650
to discuss with you.

53
00:02:35,810 --> 00:02:37,130
I wish to resign.

54
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:39,209
Are you defying my decree?

55
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,300
I wouldn't dare.

56
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:41,970
It's just that...

57
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:48,650
The Princess Royal is the big boss.

58
00:02:48,810 --> 00:02:49,500
I'd rather

59
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:52,130
stay by her side.

60
00:02:54,370 --> 00:02:55,690
(Big boss?)

61
00:02:57,210 --> 00:02:58,690
(Bei's telling me)

62
00:02:58,860 --> 00:03:00,810
(the Princess Royal is the mastermind.)

63
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:01,650
Your Majesty,

64
00:03:01,930 --> 00:03:03,740
why force him?

65
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:06,649
Ever since I met Her Highness,

66
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:07,780
I've realized

67
00:03:08,770 --> 00:03:11,020
what truly matters in life.

68
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:14,650
Titles and future mean nothing.

69
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:16,620
It's like an old man from my village.

70
00:03:17,580 --> 00:03:18,370
Yu

71
00:03:19,050 --> 00:03:19,740
Ze

72
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:21,090
cheng.

73
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:24,300
(Bei's going undercover.)

74
00:03:26,610 --> 00:03:27,930
Who's this Yu Zecheng?

75
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:29,650
Just an old man from my village.

76
00:03:30,090 --> 00:03:30,780
He

77
00:03:31,490 --> 00:03:32,780
spent his whole life chasing fame,

78
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:34,180
but in the end,

79
00:03:34,770 --> 00:03:35,780
he

80
00:03:36,330 --> 00:03:38,370
died alone.

81
00:03:40,740 --> 00:03:42,780
I've never asked you for anything.

82
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:44,179
I only hope

83
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:45,900
you'll grant us your blessing.

84
00:03:47,930 --> 00:03:51,370
Aunt, I'm deeply grateful
for your support when I chose my empress.

85
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:53,300
As for your marriage to Gu Bei,

86
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:55,210
I'll leave it to the two of you.

87
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,060
Your Majesty,

88
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:11,370
it's time to
give me today's antidote.

89
00:04:27,770 --> 00:04:29,220
"Big boss".

90
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,610
What is that?

91
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:32,940
It's a dialect from my village.

92
00:04:34,850 --> 00:04:36,530
It means master.

93
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:39,209
How do you plan

94
00:04:39,210 --> 00:04:40,530
to get rid of Xiao Ce?

95
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:41,940
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

96
00:04:42,820 --> 00:04:44,140
A party will do.

97
00:04:45,210 --> 00:04:46,170
"Party"?

98
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:48,650
Is that another village saying?

99
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:50,290
Yes, Your Majesty.

100
00:04:50,770 --> 00:04:52,380
It means a banquet.

101
00:05:09,530 --> 00:05:10,900
Have you heard?

102
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:12,960
(Xiaoyao Pavilion)
Gu Bei's marrying the Princess Royal.

103
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:14,050
I don't believe it.

104
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:14,939
Do you really think

105
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:16,209
Gu Bei would abandon us?

106
00:05:16,210 --> 00:05:17,700
Neither do I.

107
00:05:17,850 --> 00:05:18,649
But he's moved

108
00:05:18,650 --> 00:05:20,299
into the Princess Royal's residence,

109
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:21,900
and refuses to see us.

110
00:05:22,290 --> 00:05:23,410
I don't think

111
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:24,970
he's refusing to see us.

112
00:05:25,170 --> 00:05:26,490
Perhaps he can't.

113
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:27,650
You mean

114
00:05:27,770 --> 00:05:28,730
he's being controlled?

115
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:29,899
Why else

116
00:05:29,900 --> 00:05:31,289
(Xiaoyao Pavilion)
would he send word

117
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:32,457
telling us to paint the door?

118
00:05:35,260 --> 00:05:36,140
Your Majesty,

119
00:05:36,210 --> 00:05:37,050
what's

120
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:39,220
Gu Bei really up to?

121
00:05:39,530 --> 00:05:41,650
He has his reasons.

122
00:05:42,210 --> 00:05:43,490
Whatever he's doing,

123
00:05:43,970 --> 00:05:45,220
it's for our sake.

124
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:47,780
If so, let's trust him.

125
00:05:47,850 --> 00:05:48,900
Let's get to work.

126
00:05:49,500 --> 00:05:50,290
You all do it.

127
00:05:50,970 --> 00:05:51,490
You!

128
00:05:52,530 --> 00:05:54,090
What are you doing?

129
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:55,940
You should ask Gu Bei.

130
00:05:56,170 --> 00:05:57,490
He sent word

131
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:58,580
saying that

132
00:05:58,770 --> 00:06:00,820
there'll be a banquet in a few days.

133
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:01,899
He insisted

134
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:03,329
we paint the door red.

135
00:06:03,330 --> 00:06:04,260
A red door?

136
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:07,380
A banquet?

137
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:12,650
The banquet by the Western Yi

138
00:06:13,290 --> 00:06:14,380
is a setup.

139
00:06:18,770 --> 00:06:19,530
Your Majesty,

140
00:06:20,090 --> 00:06:21,329
the Western Yi envoys

141
00:06:21,330 --> 00:06:22,780
have been in the capital for days

142
00:06:23,090 --> 00:06:24,820
and wish for an audience.

143
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:26,530
Let's hold a banquet
in the imperial garden.

144
00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:28,280
The Western Yi envoys
submitted a memorial,

145
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,619
saying palace etiquette

146
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:31,260
is too strict.

147
00:06:31,530 --> 00:06:33,059
They're afraid

148
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:34,229
they might offend Your Majesty.

149
00:06:34,230 --> 00:06:36,820
They request permission

150
00:06:36,940 --> 00:06:38,139
to host a private banquet

151
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:40,050
outside the palace.

152
00:06:45,530 --> 00:06:46,380
Granted.

153
00:06:47,650 --> 00:06:48,530
But where

154
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:50,610
should it be held?

155
00:06:52,020 --> 00:06:53,090
Why not

156
00:06:53,850 --> 00:06:55,290
at Gu Bei's

157
00:06:55,460 --> 00:06:56,460
Xiaoyao Pavilion?

158
00:06:59,090 --> 00:07:00,850
You really dote on him.

159
00:07:01,770 --> 00:07:03,490
We'll do as you wish, Aunt.

160
00:07:05,770 --> 00:07:07,260
We'll host the envoys

161
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:09,490
at Xiaoyao Pavilion.

162
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:17,480
(The Best Pavilion in the World)

163
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:44,850
What

164
00:07:44,970 --> 00:07:46,090
is this?

165
00:07:46,170 --> 00:07:48,530
Fried popcorn chicken.
It cuts through grease.

166
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:49,780
Eat as much as you want.

167
00:07:59,260 --> 00:08:00,290
Emperor of Jing,

168
00:08:00,970 --> 00:08:02,020
I've never seen

169
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,220
a restaurant like this.

170
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:06,020
Thank you for your hospitality.

171
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:09,050
Allow me to offer you a toast.

172
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:10,059
This is

173
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:11,409
the Western Yi's

174
00:08:11,410 --> 00:08:12,740
finest grape wine.

175
00:08:26,970 --> 00:08:27,610
Please.

176
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:32,820
This won't do.

177
00:08:32,930 --> 00:08:34,169
How can His Majesty drink

178
00:08:34,170 --> 00:08:36,340
without appetizers?

179
00:08:36,650 --> 00:08:37,250
Hulv.

180
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:39,970
Bring His Majesty the cefixime.

181
00:08:43,900 --> 00:08:45,769
That's more like it.

182
00:08:45,770 --> 00:08:47,340
Cefixime and wine

183
00:08:47,470 --> 00:08:49,169
make quite the combination.

184
00:08:49,170 --> 00:08:50,850
(Bei's warning me)

185
00:08:51,050 --> 00:08:52,420
(the wine is poisoned.)

186
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:54,409
To everyone from far and wide,

187
00:08:54,410 --> 00:08:55,449
beautiful ladies

188
00:08:55,450 --> 00:08:56,580
and gentlemen,

189
00:08:57,810 --> 00:08:58,880
let us drink

190
00:08:59,010 --> 00:09:00,550
this toast together.

191
00:09:00,770 --> 00:09:01,540
Drink!

192
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:03,549
- Drink!
- Drink!

193
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:05,270
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

194
00:09:16,930 --> 00:09:18,340
If the poison fails

195
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:20,420
during the banquet,

196
00:09:20,650 --> 00:09:22,420
the Western Yi envoys

197
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:23,970
will take the chance

198
00:09:24,100 --> 00:09:26,090
to finish Xiao Ce off.

199
00:09:28,980 --> 00:09:29,700
Your Majesty,

200
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:32,619
I've heard the Western Yi people
are good at dancing.

201
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:34,769
Why not have them perform

202
00:09:34,770 --> 00:09:35,890
to liven up the banquet?

203
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:38,219
Very well.

204
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:39,370
We'll trouble you, envoy.

205
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:40,820
Your Majesty,

206
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:42,850
our dance

207
00:09:42,900 --> 00:09:44,340
requires swords.

208
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:45,660
May I

209
00:09:45,810 --> 00:09:46,700
use them?

210
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:50,940
Certainly.

211
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:52,660
Come.

212
00:09:53,450 --> 00:09:54,410
Bring him a sword.

213
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:10,280
(The Best Pavilion in the World)

214
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:46,719
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

215
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:49,119
♪Our spirit soars to the skies♪

216
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:54,559
♪The brainy emperor plots the strategy♪

217
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:58,919
♪The slacker general leads the charge♪

218
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:01,319
♪Swords clash and warhorses thunder♪

219
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:03,879
♪Let the history judge our deeds♪

220
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:09,559
♪Our brotherhood is priceless♪

221
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:15,120
♪Peace across the land, carefree at last♪

222
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:21,440
♪Funny moments never stop♪

223
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:24,280
♪Silly blunders never cease♪

224
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:28,639
♪Yet through every up and down♪

225
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:30,600
♪We create miracles♪

226
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:33,360
♪From naive youths♪

227
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:36,119
♪To legendary heroes♪

228
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,039
♪This journey♪

229
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:42,079
♪Is one we'll be proud of♪

230
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:44,600
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

231
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,960
♪Let's create♪

232
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:59,920
♪A legend of our own♪
